														<div class="col1-copy">
								<h3>Career Focus</h3>
<h4>Programs tailored for in-demand careers and job preparedness.</h4>
<ul>
<li><a href="/academics/beyond-the-classroom/credit-prior-learning/">Credit for Prior Learning</a><br />
Work experience, military training, language fluency, and other credentials could get you closer to a college degree than you think!</li>
<li><a href="/academics/beyond-the-classroom/competency-based-education/">Competency-Based Education</a> (CBE)<br />
NECC is leading the way forward with CBE, putting the focus on the skills you master, versus time spent learning.</li>
<li><a href="/academics/explore">Explore Majors &amp; Careers</a><br />
Explore how NECC certificate and degree programs prepare you for a variety of career paths.</li>
</ul>
