<h3>💼 November is National Career Development Month</h3>
<p>
  November celebrates National Career Development Month, highlighting the importance of professional growth and lifelong learning. It&#8217;s an opportunity for students to engage with <a href="https://necc.edu/workforce/career-services/"><strong>Career Services</strong></a>, explore <a href="https://necc.edu/academics/explore/"><strong>academic and professional pathways</strong></a>, build workplace skills, and prepare for future success.<br />
  <a href="https://ncda.org/aws/NCDA/pt/sp/ncdmonth" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><br />
    <strong>Learn more about National Career Development Month</strong><br />
  </a>
</p>
