<!-- MODULE: FACE OF NECC -->
<div class="module faces-of-necc cf">
	<div class="wrap">
		<h2>
			<span class="line1">Stories of Us</span>
			<br><span class="line2">The stories behind</span>
			<br><span class="line2">Northern Essex Students, Faculty, and Staff</span>
		</h2>

					<div class="profiles-wrap">
														<div class="profile">
													<div class="img-wrap">
								<img src="https://necc.edu/wp-content/uploads/home/greg_esol_chiclet-600x600.jpg" alt="greg_esol_chiclet">
							</div>
						
						<div class="content">
															<h3>
									Gregory Blomgren								</h3>
							
															<div class="excerpt-wrap cf">
									Gregory Blomgren spends his days teaching 4th graders at Tenney Grammar School in Methuen. Two nights a week, he drives to NECC for Adult Education (CAE) in Lawrence and teaches an entirely different kind of student: adults who left careers, degrees, and sometimes entire professional identities behind to build a new life in the United States.																			 <a href="https://necc.edu/newsroom/2026/09/18/inside-an-elementary-school-teachers-second-classroom-at-necc/" class=""><span>Hear from Gregory</span></a>																	</div>
													</div>
					</div>
														<div class="profile">
													<div class="img-wrap">
								<img src="https://necc.edu/wp-content/uploads/home/kisleiny_chiclet.jpg" alt="Photo of Kisleiny sitting on a pale backdrop smiling at the camera">
							</div>
						
						<div class="content">
															<h3>
									Kisleiny Abreu								</h3>
							
															<div class="excerpt-wrap cf">
									Campus Compact, a national coalition of colleges and universities working to advance the public purposes of higher education, has named Northern Essex Community College psychology major Kisleiny Abreu as a 2026/2027 Newman Civic Fellow.																			 <a href="https://necc.edu/newsroom/2026/09/04/psychology-major-chosen-as-newman-civic-fellow/" class=""><span>Meet Kisleiny</span></a>																	</div>
													</div>
					</div>
														<div class="profile">
													<div class="img-wrap">
								<img src="https://necc.edu/wp-content/uploads/home/ecsd_chiclet-600x600.jpg" alt="An illustration of a hand with a pencil in it shaped like a key with the text ECSD NECC">
							</div>
						
						<div class="content">
															<h3>
									Incarcerated Students Publish Literary Journal at Middleton Jail								</h3>
							
															<div class="excerpt-wrap cf">
									Northern Essex Community College, in partnership with the Essex County Sheriff’s Department, recently published the inaugural edition of the literary journal, Handwritten. It contains nearly a dozen original essays, poetry, artwork and creative writing by students at the Middleton House of Corrections. 																			 <a href="https://necc.edu/newsroom/2026/07/01/incarcerated-students-publish-literary-journal-at-middleton-jail/" class=""><span>Discover the Handwritten Journal</span></a>																	</div>
													</div>
					</div>
							</div>
		
							<a href="https://necc.edu/student-life/the-stories-of-us/" class="view-all">
				<span>Learn Our Stories</span>
			</a>
			</div>
</div>
          </div><!-- /.main -->
      </div>
